OL,3,AUS loses measles elimination status
OL,4,Aafter 26 years amid record case numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than two decades, the US has
OL,7,Flost its measles-free status, following
OL,8,Ftwo years of record case numbers and
OL,9,Fdeaths.
OL,11,FThe Pan American Health Organization
OL,12,F(PAHO), a specialised service of the
OL,13,FUnited Nations, determined the US has
OL,14,Fhad uninterrupted transmission of the
OL,15,Fsame strain of measles for more than 12
OL,16,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
