OL,3,AUS loses measles elimination status
OL,4,Aafter 26 years amid record case numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Jarbas Barbosa, director of PAHO,
OL,7,Fannounced that Mexico and Bolivia have
OL,8,Falso lost their measles elimination
OL,9,Fstatus, attributing the resurgence in
OL,10,Fthe region to persistent "gaps in
OL,11,Fvaccination".
OL,13,FThe US Centers for Disease Control and
OL,14,FPrevention (CDC) said it was committed
OL,15,Fto "regaining measles elimination
OL,16,Fstatus" by expanding access to
OL,17,Fvaccines.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
